sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GattClientResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GattClient]
    participant Peripheral as BLE Peripheral

    Note over Node, Peripheral: Messages between Node and BLE Peripheral<br>are link-layer events, not driven by the App.<br>The App only observes them through<br>Echo callbacks (e.g. ReadDescriptorResponse).
    Note over App, Node: Allowed states: connected.<br>Pre-conditions: descriptor handle known from DescriptorDiscovered.<br>Response sequences:<br>- ReadDescriptorResponse(data) -> OperationComplete(success).<br>- OperationComplete(error) on ATT / permissions failure.<br>- OperationComplete(retry) when the ATT bearer is momentarily busy.

    App->>Node: GattClient.ReadDescriptor(0x0026)

    alt Successful read
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_READ_REQ (handle=0x0026)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_READ_RSP (value)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ReadDescriptorResponse(<br>data={handle=0x0026, data=0x0000})
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)
    else ATT error (e.g. read not permitted)
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_READ_REQ (handle=0x0026)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_ERROR_RSP (error code)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(error)
    end
